		(uuid "14909438-dcb5-519b-a64c-cfaba0b8d5d7")
	)
	(text "Pinout = TTL-232R / SparkFun: 1 GND (blk)  2 CTS (brn)  3 VCC (red)  4 TXD (org)  5 RXD (yel)  6 RTS/DTR (grn)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 16 19.7 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "fbcebdfa-e04d-55c2-bab4-571c533b9402")
	)
	(text "TXD/RXD named from the FT231X side: TXD drives the target's RX. 3.3 V levels only; 1.8 V consoles use J13."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 16 22.4 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "20dd5ad3-a964-55de-a94d-b9728c0957a3")
	)
	(text "JP501: pin 6 = DTR# (bridge C-A, default) or RTS# (bridge C-B). JP502: pin 3 VCC from 3V3OUT (50 mA), open by default."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 16 25.1 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "1024a7c5-0c69-58db-a9b8-0cf94f25a7f1")
	)
	(text "VCC comes from the TPS2553 on the hub sheet (FTDI_VBUS): FTDI CYCLE power-cycles the bridge without a replug."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 16 27.8 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "2537d0ce-8525-52b1-8a0b-8b9e650680f6")
	)
	(text "CBUS defaults: CBUS1 = RXLED#, CBUS2 = TXLED# (factory MTP); change with FT_PROG if ever needed."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 16 30.5 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "092b6976-c99b-51eb-b072-6f980ef239eb")
	)
